OL,3,GNEWSAEx-police detective charged with
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former West Yorkshire Police officer
OL,7,Fhas been charged with sexual assault.
OL,9,FMelanie Baker, who previously served as
OL,10,Fa detective sergeant based in the
OL,11,FKirklees district, has been charged
OL,12,Fwith one count of sexual assault by
OL,13,Fpenetration.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police said the alleged
OL,16,Foffence is said to have taken place
OL,17,Fagainst a woman in Wakefield on 6
OL,18,FAugust 2009.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
