OL,3,GNEWSAEx-police detective charged with
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaker, who is due to appear at Leeds
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on 7 October, was
OL,8,Foff duty at the time of the alleged
OL,9,Fincident, police said. She has since
OL,10,Fretired from the force.
